exports it under the same name so _ref_lock's acquire/release/steal/renew seams are untouched' — implies the CAS path may bypass classify() entirely"],"finding":"The classifier's data-flow across its two entry kinds is under-specified: classify(result, *, operation) declares `result` as a full CompletedProcess-shaped outcome (args/returncode/stdout/stderr), but the ref-cas structural predicate is preserved verbatim taking a subprocess.CalledProcessError (.cmd/.returncode/.stderr). The plan does not state how classify bridges these shapes for the predicate path, nor whether _advisory_lock reaches CAS classification through classify() or keeps calling the re-exported _is_cas_mismatch directly.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f3db40bdf7b6d31a0","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Constraint: the classifier signature","norm_id":"n245f282435dfa310","priority":0.67,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer wires classify() to always receive a CompletedProcess and cannot invoke the CalledProcessError-typed predicate","Implementer normalizes CompletedProcess<->CalledProcessError inconsistently, silently changing when the CAS predicate fires"],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"med